2026-11-13 07:12:09,818 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 1. **Finding f_e2403aa4 (System Identification)**: Changed from "proves" to "inference" - Setting a registry default username does not prove identity equality. Multiple scenarios exist.
